# CSS Modules

Style components with CSS Modules. Use block, element, and modifier names such as `ticket-list`, `ticket-list__due`, and `ticket-list--breached`.

Do not add Tailwind utility classes to `className` or `class`.

Keep tokens in `src/styles/globals.css`. Do not invent a second palette in a component.
